  "body": "<p>This Pull Request updates dependency <a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import\">eslint-plugin-import</a> from <code>v2.7.0</code> to <code>v2.8.0</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"commits\">Commits</h3>\n<p><details><br />\n<summary>benmosher/eslint-plugin-import</summary></p>\n<h4 id=\"280\">2.8.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/95b1ba6ff1e4f79d263e152a8190ac673025e65b\"><code>95b1ba6</code></a> disable AppVeyor coveralls</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/407137948e084276c95ee8e4b393e7c8ee318bbe\"><code>4071379</code></a> #&#8203;842/#944 changelog note</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/8702af77637e57b1b98684ce196964f21e5273be\"><code>8702af7</code></a> #&#8203;744 changelog note</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/91c5318b037781cfd21229d8f2397167916f9538\"><code>91c5318</code></a> #&#8203;886 / #&#8203;891 changelog notes</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/1b3f54418f3c62a9f0cb80c49cb5d74fe3163518\"><code>1b3f544</code></a> bump v2.8.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/cef88f2a4984bea9586c10992d6af1209aee1ef8\"><code>cef88f2</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;944 from alexgorbatchev/alexgorbatchev/issue-842</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/c246b9e0dfce95fd7a8c3fc08f94a856e42e9fbb\"><code>c246b9e</code></a> #&#8203;842 Fixes Cannot read property &#x27;some&#x27; of undefined</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/1958e0b4f889f752b7b3d579b1d81c50b5f8be7a\"><code>1958e0b</code></a> [Tests] fix broken test on master</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/68f63f59538ceeb4f0348185683839be94d152c2\"><code>68f63f5</code></a> forgot @k15a&#x27;s user link 😅</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/5f5fbf6d12518e6a654c37475e9fe2644b008066\"><code>5f5fbf6</code></a> changelog notes for #&#8203;620 + #&#8203;632</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/92dd6626d126ccb165660ef50849c8eb7f3d29cc\"><code>92dd662</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;632 from k15a/master</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/1ba1c3a05251099d8422a81159bac9d72780c132\"><code>1ba1c3a</code></a> removing changelog note, will re-add</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/146f87f0b3cc7684f38b384a77e2b02b8b907288\"><code>146f87f</code></a> changelog notes for #&#8203;720 + #&#8203;858</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/57527c71adc9b80805f55faee5111ea6a529ad54\"><code>57527c7</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;858 from laysent/master</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/006ddebfea301dce3db52170182a683bcb9574ff\"><code>006ddeb</code></a> Merge remote-tracking branch &#x27;refs/remotes/benmosher/master&#x27;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/cd771330d2c487dfb486c5d333ac0c37a4d4d2f2\"><code>cd77133</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;891 from mplewis/master</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/dd281306089ba15394aeb2b85241509286442e34\"><code>dd28130</code></a> [Fix] unescape unnecessarily escaped regex slashes</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/72d13858e044569d6f194922e507578410601f28\"><code>72d1385</code></a> [Dev Deps] dev dep ranges should match peer dep ranges</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/40f56350cea6e91cbab748995e3470550ccd5d4b\"><code>40f5635</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;744 from rosswarren/master</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/ccd93942a0b9f59f1b698672ba167ece1aa9f5f1\"><code>ccd9394</code></a> docs(readme): add space (#&#8203;888)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/2f2dfb0a818f0c5cc6f5939627568636548bce97\"><code>2f2dfb0</code></a> cleanup: no exclusive tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/ed65a7412a90f4e3cf475efaff7a8ea001d6adc1\"><code>ed65a74</code></a> logic: improve scoped module scoping</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/307ddeb587ce5abc382e9c827da045f0e5dcb292\"><code>307ddeb</code></a> cleanup: no exclusive tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/benmosher/eslint-plugin-import/commit/dbc9ec735d9fd32ae69499c235f2a0deb106be94\"><code>dbc9ec7</code></a> bugfix: #&#8203;886</li>\n</ul>\n<p></details></p>\n<hr />\n<p>This PR has been generated by <a href=\"https://renovateapp.com\">Renovate Bot</a>.</p>",
